OL,3,AMan charged after fire in which woman
OL,4,Aand girl died
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man, 23, has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatal house fire.
OL,9,FNatalie McDonald, 34, died in the blaze
OL,10,Fin Grangetown, near Middlesbrough, in
OL,11,Fthe early hours of Wednesday, along
OL,12,Fwith her niece Valentina Foster, seven.
OL,14,FThe man was charged with two counts of
OL,15,Fmurder, two counts of section 18
OL,16,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent and
OL,17,Ftwo counts of attempted section 18
OL,18,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent,
OL,19,FCleveland Police say.
OL,21,FHe is scheduled to appear at Teesside
OL,22,FMagistrates' Court later on Tuesday.
